    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic gaming and ancient myth collide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parhelia is a fast-paced 2D platformer starring an invincible Sun God. The more Praise you gain, the stronger you'll become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scorch through frantic stages and rack up combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incinerate mysterious invaders and challenge your fellow deities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue Acolytes and build up your divine following</p></li></ul>",
